        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/extras/4d6f8f6f8d218844a3fde2c6f5b2bac3.avif?t=1763977381\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎄 <strong>Forget the cozy holiday magic!</strong> Dive into a <strong>biting satire of corporate life</strong> disguised as a charming Virtual Reality (VR) Christmas tale. Enjoy the immersive power of VR in this unique Christmas story featuring colorful characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, there was a little mouse who worked relentlessly to achieve a single goal: <strong>becoming somebody</strong>. Driven only by her ambition, she slowly became mean and arrogant, pushing everyone else away. Until one day, she accepted a job offer from the most prolific toymaker in the world: <strong>Santa Claus</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The little mouse was about to find out that <strong>climbing the corporate ladder was not all that she had hoped it would be...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/extras/81e23ec8fe36616710fdf9de36c51ede.poster.avif?t=1763977381\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/extras/81e23ec8fe36616710fdf9de36c51ede.webm?t=1763977381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/extras/81e23ec8fe36616710fdf9de36c51ede.mp4?t=1763977381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The sad story of the little mouse who wanted to become somebody</i> is a 28-minute narrative Virtual Reality experience. It's perfect for introducing people to Virtual Reality during the festive season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This experience has already won over audiences since its premiere at the Venice Film Festival.</p>",
